dashboard on the author's Götze & Jensen KT975K. Facts about the kettles (Tuya category "bh" data points,
status values, temperature ranges) come from the author's kettle and from these public sources, gratefully
acknowledged – facts only, no code was copied:

- Home Assistant core – Tuya integration (Apache-2.0) – entity mapping of the "bh" smart kettle category
  https://github.com/home-assistant/core/tree/dev/homeassistant/components/tuya
- tuya-local – make-all (MIT) – kettle device configurations (data points, ranges, status values)
  https://github.com/make-all/tuya-local
- hejdom.pl – review of the SETTI+ KT950W smart kettle in Home Assistant
  https://hejdom.pl/blog/75-setti/559-smart-czajnik-setti-kt950w-1-7l-2200w.html
- homeswitch.pl – button-card dashboard for the SETTI+ KT950W
  https://blog.homeswitch.pl/czajnik/

